    "updated_at": "2025-08-14T14:20:23Z",
    "body": "I'm sorry, but I don't really understand the issue you are trying to raise. Generally nothing integrates with the Fetch API directly and the Fetch API itself is just a thin layer on top of \"fetch\", which is indeed quite big and at times vague.\n\nAnd while Fetch had a bit more to say about WebSockets in the past as noted at https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#websocket-protocol, it no longer does (except for some very specific code paths).",
